{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e8e94daa4dfb18642f4f6b686f43887aaee720d8beff08f3b58c617f3ce2b52f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3142b26ca3a8d2a3b26f71081308257c856cb69d321d1cb77fb4aad99d7411a4",
      "text": "再这样隐瞒自己的真实身份下去……\n对任何人都没有好处，我是这么想的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dad07a2d26ea7bd8b32e8df4f89f8ba3f8199c552fdc6ed83af5ef33d9bb9ad",
      "text": "吓到大家了，对不起。\n但是……这是事实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c945e39ea30ae5af60efeb3b4090ed0424c51dd51bad0fa4228bddca3df1fe95",
      "text": "虽然此前一直作为女性偶像在活动，\n但我……其实是个男孩子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9220313dbcfaa484c5617bce4d336b2c8c4cc93bd7d18834ed746fc188a038e",
      "text": "我苦恼了很久。\n被各种各样的人反对，到底要不要坦白……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bed26099878c2f1329b65a3c5b1d9d722f4a85e6cf67c147be478b6d6093475",
      "text": "只要我自己默默忍耐下去的话，\n大概一切就能圆满收场了吧。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23bb208f9f04e9c3511346699b9cfc3d1a669f82f8fddcd2de008e659d832a3d",
      "text": "如果作为偶像的我，舍弃了以真实的面貌歌唱\n这最大的梦想的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a036b1db61b192fafb17512273cb2fb65ba5161724d80019306a8df57dc90228",
      "text": "那我就再也没有，\n向别人畅谈梦想的资格了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24104c121db3865a65b6dd7ba4d8bd974be73984531d7eebc09eb784634badba",
      "text": "正因为现在我鼓起勇气坦白了一切，\n才能够说出这句话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b0538620005885e5c47e20a52b027f851ba680260de0b092c634194b44e9a7d",
      "text": "各位，请不要放弃梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddd2beb5d319b25eaf8fe40ad671a7770d5941105ac1d2e0b846e1073948c9c2",
      "text": "只要还有一件事能做，\n梦想就依然有实现的可能。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:482dfa600b132d891254773d1f7b1b541e0cd4f46e461696033e62995b5d8b9a",
      "text": "最后，请听听看吧。……我真正的歌声！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a2cad500a4286d1e3a0a9ce5a966a445bff998457ba9635d9777cdc80f1e357",
      "text": "…………\n真实的面貌……吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
